      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "OK, why doesn't this exist yet? I mean, probably because no avatar improvements have been made since the date of this ticket, but still.\nAnimator parameters such as:\nIndexFinger0 (Float)\nIndexFinger1 (Float)\nIndexFinger2 (Float)\nIndexFinger3 (Float)\nIndexFinger4 (Float)",
      "viewerReactions": null
