      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f84827881e0832ac8133b0e|full_name}: I bet we don't have access to these parameters because only Index controllers (and another one I forgot the name of) and gloves support this right now and they don't want to alienate users of the other controllers, but it would be super useful to have and a very straightforward solution.",
