  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-09-09T10:48:39.286Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The default finger tracking ranges can look weird in some avatars, specially the thumb which is in a really weird position when lifted. I believe Avatars 3.0 are the perfect way of implementing a way of being able to configure the finger positions.\nIt could either be done by inputting the finger positions somewhere (choosing how much they close/open) either by values or animations, or by giving us parameters with the value of every finger so we can build it ourselves.",
